<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκστᾰτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inclined to depart from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ λογισμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1145b11
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξης,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμμενετικὸς δόξῃ,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1146a18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>excitable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. διὰ τὸν θυμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>PA</u>
					650b34
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>out of one's senses,</i> of Ajax, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				953a
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.2a
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Dio</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>able to displace</i> or <i>remove,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.951c
				</span></i>
			 : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀλλοίωσις ἐ. κίνησις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.3.21
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>causing mental derangement,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.13.4
			</span></i>.</div>
